Who would have thought that the game engine known as Hero Engine would perform poorly and hinder the developers' ability to create their virtual world? Now they've decided to move development of The Repopulation to the traditional Unreal Engine to avoid all the pressing issues and unpleasant experiences.

At the same time, the team from Above and Beyond Technologies announced that they are actively working on another gaming project called Fragmented and have already managed to tell a lot of interesting things about their new game:
- Fragmented is a spin-off of The Repopulation, but now the game will have much more action and many other interesting gameplay elements. Testing of the new project is scheduled for February;
- Many game elements and even entire projects from The Repopulation will be transferred to the new game Fragmented;
- We are happy to inform all owners of the original The Repopulation that you will receive Fragmented is free;
- at Fragmented It will be possible to play on both custom and official servers;
- according to the standard in Fragmented PvE and PvP modes with a unique first and third person system will be available;
- Fragmented – this is already an independent shooter with RPG elements;
- the ability to create your own cities, herd animals, farm and craft, all of this will remain yours;
- there will be a huge selection of different pets and mounts;
- a dynamic change of day and night will be introduced into the game;
- the game will be available for play through a virtual reality headset.

Another interesting aspect of the game Fragmented Familiar character skills will be simplified, including Constructions, Melee, Refining, and others. The new skills will have improved bonuses, lower requirements, and other simplified elements.

Fragmented – This is a reworked version of an old game that promises to radically change the gaming experience. Once the project is ready, you'll be able to download it immediately. Fragmented Download it for free via torrent on our website. The key is to catch this news and react to it promptly. A grand, redesigned, and already engaging virtual world awaits us.

